{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1000_017kth", "source_sha256": "8972dcf04b829d02a4bed75c353bdded32a71b8c4213f8b144a9fe6e8ba42a1a", "ja": "待ち合わせまで、まだ少しあるけど……\n遅刻しないように、早めに出なくちゃ！", "zh": "距离碰头的时间还有一点，不过……\n为了不迟到，得早点出门才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1001_se", "source_sha256": "878d8effff3d6eeb4a9bc61e57cd66acf230c5d355dcb026802e0bf6f8007dab", "ja": "ガチャ！　バタバタバタ……", "zh": "扭蛋！　扑棱扑棱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1002_se", "source_sha256": "aed3f3bf018176ad6180637f46b7de0254dc8f113c1cf575454c618a9d141d6d", "ja": "……ガチャ", "zh": "……咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "5c9f741d8a0c91db670b10c2a35accbabe9d4c15d2de888bde2555254ac20ee8", "ja": "ふふ。琴葉は真、楽しそうな様子でしたね。\n心なしか、足取りも弾んで見えました。", "zh": "呵呵。琴叶看起来真的很开心呢。  \n不知是不是我的错觉，连脚步都显得轻快了几分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "77d43b08738617d441dd2648710c447fb326dd9f74c2f08ebfa5c079eff278b8", "ja": "琴葉さん、今日は{$P$}さんと\nデートですもんね！", "zh": "琴叶，今天要和{$P$}先生约会嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "9b6e7166960407e5755336045c4c6bd55b42fa60bd4d083ab0d7aaafda537c3e", "ja": "琴葉さんと{$P$}さんのデート……！\nい、今すぐ後を追いかけて、見守りたい……！！", "zh": "琴叶和{$P$}先生的约会……！\n我、我想现在就追上去，在一旁守望……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b8648c606749fa6bc6092f289eea8336e5152a97b8ef80b25f2c25d545656846", "ja": "七尾さん。気持ちはわかりますが覗きはいけません。\n今日はせっかく、ふたりきりなのですから。", "zh": "七尾同学，我理解你的心情，但偷看是不行的。难得今天是他们两个人独处呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1007_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8d933512de107b5597dff1934aa4a62f98e9b8a85aa0a4218e56a04f1d8883bf", "ja": "お、みんないたのか。\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "哦，大家都在啊。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "28bed2dd2ae65f0979d6ec503ced431572ead59140c8ad9d41a4d9ea13f161f5", "ja": "{$P$}？　あなたという人は……\nデートだというのに、ここで何をしているんです？", "zh": "{$P$}？　你这个人真是……\n明明都要约会了，还在这里做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1010_p", "source_sha256": "30a47dcf4117c5ff4085367bdf7a941a3a5c2ff7736cf06a06c98a3090dc3d97", "ja": "いや、ちょっと仕事があって。それに\n約束の時間までまだ少しあるし、急がなくても……。", "zh": "没有啦，手头刚好有点工作。而且\n离约好的时间还有一会儿，不用那么着急……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "115958200909ddb1e2d516653514502ec6c64f5b11534276ecc753a80aace53a", "ja": "ダメですよ、{$P$}さん！\nデートなんですから、早く行かないと！", "zh": "不行啦，{$P$}先生！\n既然是约会，就得赶紧出发才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "924bc1e68d757b0482afaf03dda1d84695422ca78e93e29791bdb4e191c180a5", "ja": "星梨花の言うとおりです。今日は真、大事な日。\n一分一秒も早く駆けつけなくては。", "zh": "正如星梨花所说。今天对真来说，是非常重要的日子。\n必须尽快赶过去，一分一秒都不能耽搁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "4d4dbdb0180e59dcf8084f187e19947de3b8aef32f861e99159e116fca81ac18", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n今すぐ、待ち合わせ場所に向かってください！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n请现在立刻赶往集合地点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1014_p", "source_sha256": "667febbb432ecd6b0a98e39d0f9fe1dddc748d390f2bb4369f967c8a90ce055b", "ja": "わ、わかったよ、わかったから……。\nそれじゃ、行ってくる！", "zh": "好、好啦，我知道了就是了……\n那我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1015_null", "source_sha256": "dbb2cf6e32d49cf0e99fde87a32a2402d74de075ebe0f947a48830fe33b37449", "ja": "ガチャッ、バタン！\nバタバタバタ……", "zh": "咔嚓、砰！\n扑通扑通扑通……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1016_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2c334f525bc2656cd326ef12a52a51b59bbbfa266edac1d93c2715d045e918bf", "ja": "はぁ……ようやく行きましたね。こちらに言われないと\n急ごうともしないとは、つくづく呆れた方です。", "zh": "唉……总算走了。要不是我催促，连赶快行动都不会，真是让人无语。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "9fd82dc8b67ef44db261ff3746023cb6d0a254c458b6c43c81f1c5ba71ccdc80", "ja": "でもこれで、デートもうまくいきますよね？\nよかったです！", "zh": "不过这样一来，约会也会顺利进行吧？太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "a7fdc904d93565a6b3ea0dbcb9f60de4ed5966834534b3efb40e5a9c0bcb5189", "ja": "ええ。よき日となるよう、\n私たちも祈りましょう。", "zh": "嗯。愿那一天成为美好的一天，\n我们也一起祈祷吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "613e442db30ffe6eb4198d34d68465d2a5d4bd5132ff03f8a55557bd690c548b", "ja": "琴葉さん、今頃ドキドキしてるかなぁ。まだかなって\n時間を気にしたりして……ああ、想像が膨らみます！", "zh": "琴叶现在是不是正心跳加速呢？还会想着“还没好吗”，时不时留意时间……啊啊，想象越来越丰富了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "554a1879e51a5d7bd389ec63820aa55a1bfc4edb69e20a3339df8e0cd4c2a022", "ja": "……。\n{$P$}、まだかな……。", "zh": "……。\n{$P$}，还没来吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1021_p", "source_sha256": "f1db7474e4f48212afb563b111b9bb0a876a412f51a4b4da66b867e6a25cb14e", "ja": "琴葉、お疲れ様！\n待たせてすまなかった。", "zh": "琴叶，辛苦了！\n让你久等了，抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "9084cb99d33446c05596d53daae8dc772d11b617b21b8246d0866b033e5704c2", "ja": "{$P$}！\nい、いえ！　私も今来たところで！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n没、没有！我也才刚到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1023_p", "source_sha256": "f4088b24e3dc31b6d587146996ee1514ef256ae9196bfc6f3f17cf019aed54a1", "ja": "そうか、ならよかった。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1024_p", "source_sha256": "781c0a51d1ace65afc1b782e7718dddf83f9b436b71eb360a86a1146ace2a131", "ja": "今日のお芝居、すごく話題になってるみたいだな。\nそれじゃ、行こうか！", "zh": "今天的演出好像成了热门话题。\n那么，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "8e677b2a93714e6ade1097526f25a9cbf61d9ed66b478f0b48b3f10f2004143c", "ja": "ひゃ、ひゃい！", "zh": "呀、呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_155_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_155_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5c124e3ddbab31baf9844e12c18b34ce218759485ae27e2a2a1d83bdb748dc0f", "ja": "（今日は琴葉とふたりで、舞台を観に行く。\nどうしてこんな事になったかと言うと……）", "zh": "（今天要和琴叶两个人一起去看舞台剧。至于为什么会变成这样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
